{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bunny Beats</i> is a listening first rhythm learning game with procedurally generated rhythms, so no two games will be the same. Each bunny swings its mochi hammer with a distinct rhythm, and the player must listen to and master the rhythms on the fly to make the best mochi! Different mochi flavors also correspond to more challenging game modes to put a unique spin on the core rhythm game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Bunny Beats</i>, rhythms are generated using an algorithm developed by musicians, ensuring that the rhythms deliver musical variety while maintaining that human touch! Enjoy the fast-paced action of <i>Bunny Beats</i>, and train your musical sense while you\u2019re having fun! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917640/extras/3559c2cad32bd8ba2d61c040e9cffb74.poster.avif?t=1775543694\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917640/extras/3559c2cad32bd8ba2d61c040e9cffb74.webm?t=1775543694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917640/extras/3559c2cad32bd8ba2d61c040e9cffb74.mp4?t=1775543694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy procedurally generated rhythm tracks for a distinct experience each game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go head-to-head with your friends in the local multiplayer mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your ear with different mochi flavors, each with a twist on the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your endurance in the relentless Festival Mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with other players around the world to pursue the highest scores!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write custom tracks and enjoy rhythms composed by players like you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your custom gear with full MIDI support for the game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917640/extras/4b3d5bf2cbeb1fd93a7453ffee790b39.poster.avif?t=1775543694\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917640/extras/4b3d5bf2cbeb1fd93a7453ffee790b39.webm?t=1775543694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917640/extras/4b3d5bf2cbeb1fd93a7453ffee790b39.mp4?t=1775543694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/917640?t=1775543694","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/917640?t=1775543694","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917640/eb470ab2e1af5c9bdb4c6abbd5934bc228a54021/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775543694","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917640/eb470ab2e1af5c9bdb4c6abbd5934bc228a54021/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775543694","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"con